// A system that sets a row of a buffer outside any `for`
// (Inputs/buffer_set_fused.ent) is not put together with the systems
// around it when a program is built for all the cores: it was, and what
// it sets was then left as it stood in the program, which did not build.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/buffer_set_fused.ent 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %ent run --parallel %S/Inputs/buffer_set_fused.ent 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s

// CHECK: 36 7
